R13	Addressee Arg1:T7 Arg2:T11	
R14	Speaker Arg1:T2 Arg2:T11	
T12	Quotation 4261 4278	"My dear Holmes,"
T13	Cue 4279 4283	said
T14	Entity 4284 4285	I
T15	Quotation 4287 4655	"this is too much. You would certainly have been burned, had you lived a few centuries ago. It is true that I had a country walk on Thursday and came home in a dreadful mess, but as I have changed my clothes I can't imagine how you deduce it. As to Mary Jane, she is incorrigible, and my wife has given her notice, but there, again, I fail to see how you work it out."
