T60	Entity 8494 8496	He
T61	Quotation 8546 8814	"Eglow, Eglonitz-- here we are, Egria. It is in a German-speaking country-- in Bohemia, not far from Carlsbad. 'Remarkable as being the scene of the death of Wallenstein, and for its numerous glass-factories and paper-mills.' Ha, ha, my boy, what do you make of that?"
