R222	Speaker Arg1:T145 Arg2:T160	
R223	Addressee Arg1:T133 Arg2:T160	
T161	Quotation 16020 16053	"We were both in the photograph."
R224	Addressee Arg1:T145 Arg2:T161	
R225	Speaker Arg1:T133 Arg2:T161	
T162	Quotation 16054 16134	"Oh, dear! That is very bad! Your Majesty has indeed committed an indiscretion."
R226	Speaker Arg1:T145 Arg2:T162	
R227	Addressee Arg1:T133 Arg2:T162	
T163	Quotation 16135 16156	"I was mad-- insane."
R228	Addressee Arg1:T145 Arg2:T163	
R229	Speaker Arg1:T133 Arg2:T163	
T164	Quotation 16157 16199	"You have compromised yourself seriously."
R230	Speaker Arg1:T145 Arg2:T164	
R231	Addressee Arg1:T133 Arg2:T164	
T165	Quotation 16200 16265	"I was only Crown Prince then. I was young. I am but thirty now."
R232	Addressee Arg1:T145 Arg2:T165	
R233	Speaker Arg1:T133 Arg2:T165	
T166	Quotation 16266 16289	"It must be recovered."
R234	Speaker Arg1:T145 Arg2:T166	
R235	Addressee Arg1:T133 Arg2:T166	
T167	Quotation 16290 16317	"We have tried and failed."
R236	Addressee Arg1:T145 Arg2:T167	
R237	Speaker Arg1:T133 Arg2:T167	
T168	Quotation 16318 16361	"Your Majesty must pay. It must be bought."
R238	Speaker Arg1:T145 Arg2:T168	
R239	Addressee Arg1:T133 Arg2:T168	
T169	Quotation 16362 16382	"She will not sell."
R240	Addressee Arg1:T145 Arg2:T169	
R241	Speaker Arg1:T133 Arg2:T169	
T170	Quotation 16383 16398	"Stolen, then."
R242	Speaker Arg1:T145 Arg2:T170	
R243	Addressee Arg1:T133 Arg2:T170	
T171	Quotation 16399 16579	"Five attempts have been made. Twice burglars in my pay ransacked her house. Once we diverted her luggage when she travelled. Twice she has been waylaid. There has been no result."
R244	Addressee Arg1:T145 Arg2:T171	
R245	Speaker Arg1:T133 Arg2:T171	
T172	Quotation 16580 16596	"No sign of it?"
R246	Speaker Arg1:T145 Arg2:T172	
R247	Addressee Arg1:T133 Arg2:T172	
T173	Quotation 16597 16615	"Absolutely none."
T174	Entity 16616 16622	Holmes
R248	Addressee Arg1:T174 Arg2:T173	
