T176	Cue 16671 16675	said
T177	Entity 16676 16678	he
R249	Cueing Arg1:T176 Arg2:T175	
R250	Speaker Arg1:T177 Arg2:T175	
T178	Quotation 16680 16711	"But a very serious one to me,"
T179	Cue 16712 16720	returned
T180	Entity 16721 16729	the King
R251	Cueing Arg1:T179 Arg2:T178	
R252	Speaker Arg1:T180 Arg2:T178	
