R254	Addressee Arg1:T180 Arg2:T175	
R255	Addressee Arg1:T177 Arg2:T178	
T181	Quotation 16745 16813	"Very, indeed. And what does she propose to do with the photograph?"
R256	Addressee Arg1:T180 Arg2:T181	
R257	Speaker Arg1:T177 Arg2:T181	
T182	Quotation 16814 16827	"To ruin me."
R258	Speaker Arg1:T180 Arg2:T182	
R259	Addressee Arg1:T177 Arg2:T182	
