R260	Addressee Arg1:T180 Arg2:T183	
R261	Speaker Arg1:T177 Arg2:T183	
T184	Quotation 16839 16866	"I am about to be married."
R262	Speaker Arg1:T180 Arg2:T184	
R263	Addressee Arg1:T177 Arg2:T184	
T185	Quotation 16867 16885	"So I have heard."
R264	Addressee Arg1:T180 Arg2:T185	
R265	Speaker Arg1:T177 Arg2:T185	
T186	Quotation 16886 17133	"To Clotilde Lothman von Saxe-Meningen, second daughter of the King of Scandinavia. You may know the strict principles of her family. She is herself the very soul of delicacy. A shadow of a doubt as to my conduct would bring the matter to an end."
R266	Speaker Arg1:T180 Arg2:T186	
R267	Addressee Arg1:T177 Arg2:T186	
T187	Quotation 17134 17152	"And Irene Adler?"
R268	Addressee Arg1:T180 Arg2:T187	
R269	Speaker Arg1:T177 Arg2:T187	
T188	Quotation 17153 17479	"Threatens to send them the photograph. And she will do it. I know that she will do it. You do not know her, but she has a soul of steel. She has the face of the most beautiful of women, and the mind of the most resolute of men. Rather than I should marry another woman, there are no lengths to which she would not go-- none."
R270	Speaker Arg1:T180 Arg2:T188	
R271	Addressee Arg1:T177 Arg2:T188	
T189	Quotation 17480 17524	"You are sure that she has not sent it yet?"
R272	Speaker Arg1:T177 Arg2:T189	
R273	Addressee Arg1:T180 Arg2:T189	
T190	Quotation 17525 17537	"I am sure."
R274	Speaker Arg1:T180 Arg2:T190	
R275	Addressee Arg1:T177 Arg2:T190	
T191	Quotation 17538 17548	"And why?"
R276	Addressee Arg1:T180 Arg2:T191	
R277	Speaker Arg1:T177 Arg2:T191	
T192	Quotation 17549 17675	"Because she has said that she would send it on the day when the betrothal was publicly proclaimed. That will be next Monday."
R278	Speaker Arg1:T180 Arg2:T192	
R279	Addressee Arg1:T177 Arg2:T192	
T193	Quotation 17676 17710	"Oh, then we have three days yet,"
T194	Cue 17711 17715	said
T195	Entity 17716 17722	Holmes
R280	Cueing Arg1:T194 Arg2:T193	
R281	Speaker Arg1:T195 Arg2:T193	
R282	Addressee Arg1:T180 Arg2:T193	
T196	Quotation 17736 17896	"That is very fortunate, as I have one or two matters of importance to look into just at present. Your Majesty will, of course, stay in London for the present?"
R283	Speaker Arg1:T195 Arg2:T196	
R284	Cueing Arg1:T194 Arg2:T196	
