R287	Speaker Arg1:T180 Arg2:T197	
T198	Quotation 17981 18044	"Then I shall drop you a line to let you know how we progress."
R288	Speaker Arg1:T195 Arg2:T198	
R289	Addressee Arg1:T180 Arg2:T198	
T199	Quotation 18045 18082	"Pray do so. I shall be all anxiety."
