R446	Addressee Arg1:T303 Arg2:T308	
R447	Speaker Arg1:T268 Arg2:T308	
T309	Quotation 30303 30407	"That is excellent. I think, perhaps, it is almost time that I prepare for the new role I have to play."
R448	Speaker Arg1:T303 Arg2:T309	
R449	Addressee Arg1:T268 Arg2:T309	
T310	Quotation 31773 31783	"You see,"
