R467	Addressee Arg1:T312 Arg2:T321	
R468	Speaker Arg1:T313 Arg2:T321	
T322	Quotation 33094 33112	"I will not look."
R469	Speaker Arg1:T312 Arg2:T322	
R470	Addressee Arg1:T313 Arg2:T322	
T323	Quotation 33113 33125	"What then?"
R471	Addressee Arg1:T312 Arg2:T323	
R472	Speaker Arg1:T313 Arg2:T323	
